     * Assigned 0x39 to MAP_REDIRECTED_DEVICE_INTERRUPT as 0x38 was already
       taken. (Roman)
     * Fixed error handling for copy_to_user(). (Roman)
     * Moved comment about unmapping above the conditional statement. (Roman)

